# Touch targets: each tab at least 44 points wide and tall (UI-082), a Slider 44 tall with
# its track's size kept (UI-105).
tap targets
expect Go frame _ _ 44 44
expect Up frame _ _ 44 44
expect slider frame _ _ _ 44
# A Select named with ui_style_next is heard with its name and its option (UI-092).
expect "Sort, Newest" exists
tap "Sort, Newest"
tap Oldest
expect "Sort, Oldest" exists
